linkedinJobDescription:
Groupe SEB is the global leader in small domestic equipment and professional coffee solutions. Within Groupe SEB France, in the Digital Marketing team, my missions are tranversal. They include :
- Participating in development of overall media strategy (TV & paid digital) in close collaboration with the media agency (Dentsu and Numberly) ;
- Managing transversal strategic projects across brands with a measurable impact on business performance ;
- Analyzing campaigns performances reviews with the media agency, delivering insights and recommandations to optimize media efficency (Rowenta, Krups, Moulinex) ;
- Collaborating with transversal internal teams (digital, data, product, sales, and e-commerce) ;
- Managing the webmastering of various Discovery/Landing Pages ;
- Attending exclusive online and in-person training sessions with Amazon, Google and Meta headquarters France on DSP and digital advertising best practices ;
- Conducting benchmarking and market intelligence on digital practices in the market.

Main projects : 
- Enhanced a shared marketing dashboard used across SEB marketing teams (Project Managers, Product Managers, Marketing Directors) to monitor activation campaigns for key brands (Rowenta, Calor, Moulinex, Tefal, Krups) ;

- Benchmarked Dreame and Philips to analyze market share and share of voice ; provided strategic recommendations for Rowenta and Krups.

Daily tools : Google Analytics, Kantar, Pathmatics, Nielsen, Talkwalker, Qlik, Teams, Outlook, Excel, PowerPoint.

